tems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4935330,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4935330-1846651706688501","game_id":"steam-4935330","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 0.9.5","summary":"Thanks for all the reports. The one we heard most was that the Bacteria shows up too often. This update is mostly about that.The Bacteria does not show up as often. f it loses track of you and you never actually see it, it tries one more time and then goes quiet for a good while. Before this, it could keep coming back every minute or so. That was a bug, not the plan.Scares are spaced out more. There are longer quiet stretches between events, so when something does happen it means more.Doors are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T01:45:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688501","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935330-1846018067939694","game_id":"steam-4935330","kind":"announcement","title":"The Backrooms: Threshold now has an official Discord server.","summary":"The Backrooms: Threshold now has an official Discord server.https://discord.gg/rWwwTRSDfwIt's where I'll be talking to players directly while the demo is out. There are channels for bug reports, performance reports, and suggestions, so if something broke or ran badly for you, that's the fastest way to get it in front of me. Every update I post here on Steam shows up there automatically too.There's also a found footage section. Post your tapes, screenshots, and clips from Level 0. I watch them.Th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T01:11:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067939694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935330-1846018067937378","game_id":"steam-4935330","kind":"update","title":"Demo update 0.9.1","summary":"Thanks for all the performance reports this week. This update addresses the most common ones.Performance Fixed the biggest sources of stutter and freezing, including the frame drops when a Still Life reaches you and a memory leak in the shadows that got worse the longer you played.Detect for this PCRecommended settings are now based on how the game actually runs on your machine instead of your hardware name. Re-run it from the settings menu to get the new result.Fixes Dying to a Still Life no lo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-10T21:54:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937378","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4935330-1846018067927950","game_id":"steam-4935330","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Demo Out Now!","summary":"The free demo of The Backrooms: Threshold is live on Steam.Open the portal and step into Level 0 with nothing but a camcorder and a Dowser. Every trip through the portal generates a new stretch of the Backrooms, so no two expeditions are the same. Your job: bring back footageFind and film proof of what is down there:- Signs of life- Anomalous rooms- No-clipped objectsWhen you have what you came for, use the Dowser to find your way back to the lab. Make a tape at the VCR, watch it back on the TV,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T01:00:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927950","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:10:22Z","discov